<title>BELGIUM: Belgian car registrations up 2.9% in yr to Sept.</title>
<headline>Belgian car registrations up 2.9% in yr to Sept.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian new car registrations rose 2.9 percent in the year to September 30 compared with the same year ago period, according to figures from the Belgian National Statistics Institute.</p>
<p>Registrations were also up 2.9 percent in September from September 1995.</p>
<p>    BELGIAN CAR REGISTRATIONS Sept 1996     Sept 1995</p>
<p>    Month			    25,854	  25,119</p>
<p>    Cumulative Jan-Sept	 323,259	 314,062</p>
<p>September 1996 registrations by manufacturer and market share for those above three percent versus 1995 period.</p>
<p> VW	    5,981 (23.1 pct)  vs   4,612  (18.4 pct)</p>
<p> Peugeot     3,313 (12.8 pct)  vs   3,682  (14.7 pct)</p>
<p> GM	    2,568 ( 9.9 pct)  vs   2,584  (10.3 pct)</p>
<p> Ford Motor  2,432 ( 9.4 pct)  vs   2,619  (10.4 pct)</p>
<p> Renault     2,003 ( 7.7 pct)  vs   2,347  ( 9.3 pct)</p>
<p> BMW	   1,404 ( 5.4 pct)  vs   1,120  ( 4.5 pct)</p>
<p> Toyota	1,362 ( 5.3 pct)  vs   1,518  ( 6.0 pct)</p>
<p> Fiat	  1,196 ( 4.6 pct)  vs   1,203  ( 4.6 pct)</p>
<p> Mercedes    1,143 ( 4.4 pct)  vs     865  ( 3.4 pct)</p>
<p> Volvo	   845 ( 3.3 pct)  vs     634  ( 2.5 pct)</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
